1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.260
采访者: And are they right?
那么，他们的判断是对的吗？

2
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:11.560
本吉奥: Yeah, they are. Of course, I don't have a crystal ball.
是的，他们是这样。当然，我没有能预知未来的水晶球。

3
00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:26.300
本吉奥: So there are a lot of research questions which remain unsolved, and it might take just a couple of years or decades to solve them, we don't know. But even if, say, scientific research on the topic stopped right now.
所以，仍有很多研究问题没有解决。解决它们可能只需几年，也可能要几十年，我们并不知道。但即使这个领域的科学研究现在就停止，

4
00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:40.330
本吉奥: And you took the current state of the art in terms of the science, and you just applied it, right, collecting lots of data sets because these algorithms need a lot of data.
只采用当前科学上的最先进成果，然后去应用它们，收集大量数据集，因为这些算法需要大量数据。

5
00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:45.550
本吉奥: Just applying the current science would already have a huge impact on society.
仅仅应用现有科学成果，就已经会对社会产生巨大影响。

6
00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:51.680
本吉奥: So I don't think they're making a very risky bet,
所以，我不认为他们下的是一个风险很大的赌注。

7
00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:57.080
本吉奥: but it could be even better because we could actually approach human level intelligence.
但结果还可能更好，因为我们也许真的能接近人类水平的智能。

8
00:00:57.080 --> 00:00:59.130
采访者: You know that or you think so?
你是知道这一点，还是这么认为？

9
00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:00.150
本吉奥: We could.
我是说，我们有可能做到。

10
00:01:00.150 --> 00:01:16.040
本吉奥: I think that we'll have other challenges to deal with and some of them we currently know are in front of us, others we probably will discover when we get there.
我认为，我们还会面临其他挑战。有些挑战，我们现在就知道在前面等着；还有一些，我们大概只有走到那一步才会发现。
